<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109766" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕστριξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐχος</span> (but
		in <i><span class="en">
			Opp.
			<u>C.</u>
			3.391
		</span></i>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑστρίγγων,</span> from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕστριγξ</span></b> ) ὁ and ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>porcupine, Hystrix cristata,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.192
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				490b29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				579a29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				600a28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				1.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in pl.,
			something obtained from pigs, prob. <i>bristles,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕστριχας</span> (acc. pl.) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢ σίδηρον</span> as instruments of
			punishment, prob. <i>whips, the cat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				8.14
			</span></i>; cf. sq. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
